          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "library/10665-266967/blocks/prose-sec-002",
      "source": "sections/sec-002-employed.md",
      "source_hash": "3349471df2e17cd1a4e5c65fdfbb30b996bb4ae9b62ba069828f19e801b0a5b9",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "Describes the methods, including the mice used, the dog street-virus challenge strain, the mouse potency test and the two antirabies sera with their dilutions. It also gives the dosage schedules for the duck-embryo vaccine.",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt6Ag2x8GsfdRq4ALsz"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "library/10665-266967/blocks/prose-sec-003",
      "source": "sections/sec-003-and.md",
      "source_hash": "4ff40a385615706aec876bfc9356d14fb1991f8947bee902cd8e12f2ec77d8be",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "Describes how the HEP Flury vaccine was reconstituted and given in two dosage schedules, and introduces the pooled phenolized vaccine.",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt6Ag2x8GsfdRq4ALsz"
