      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "The French summary of the rabies vaccine study, restating that duck-embryo and HEP Flury vaccines protected guinea-pigs poorly compared with pooled phenolized vaccine. It concludes that the recommended human dose of duck-embryo vaccine is inadequate and HEP Flury is unsuited for use after a bite.",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
